### 1. Voeg activiteit toe aan trip 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visit Eiffel Tower",
  "description": "Famous landmark in Paris",
  "time": "10:00",
  "location": "Champ de Mars, Paris",
  "estimatedCost": 25.50
}

### 2. Voeg nog een activiteit toe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seine River Cruise",
  "description": "Boat tour along the Seine",
  "time": "14:30",
  "location": "Port de la Bourdonnais",
  "estimatedCost": 15.00
}

### 3. Haal alle activiteiten voor trip 1 op
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/activities

### 4. Haal specifieke activiteit op
GET http://localhost:8080/api/activities/1

### 5. Update activiteit
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/activities/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visit Eiffel Tower - Updated",
  "description": "Famous landmark in Paris with photo session",
  "time": "11:00",
  "location": "Champ de Mars, Paris",
  "estimatedCost": 30.00
}

### 6. Haal activiteiten met kosten op
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/activities/with-cost

### 7. Verwijder activiteit
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/activities/2

### 8. Test met trip 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/2/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Beach Day",
  "description": "Relaxing at the beach",
  "time": "morning",
  "location": "Bondi Beach",
  "estimatedCost": 0
}

### 9. Activiteiten voor trip 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/2/activities